<span class="dim">┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐    ┌──────────────┐</span>
│  <span class="hi">MARKETING</span>   │    │   <span class="hi">VIRTUAL</span>    │    │     <span class="hi">AI</span>       │
│    <span class="hi">DESK</span>     │<span class="hi">───▶</span>│  <span class="hi">ASSISTANT</span>  │<span class="hi">───▶</span>│    <span class="hi">DESK</span>     │
│              │    │     <span class="hi">DESK</span>     │    │              │
<span class="dim">└──────────────┘    └──────────────┘    └──────────────┘</span>
  Brand. Story.       Ops. Clarity.     Systems. Scale.</pre>

