        <p class="case-detail">She got brand voice, creative direction, a finished website, and SEO that made her show up. Jando never caught up.</p>
        <a class="cta-link" href="/marketing">Marketing Desk <span class="arr">→</span></a>
      </article>

      <article class="case-card glow-card">
